        0.174,
        0.463,
        0.825,
        0.52
      ],
      "type": "paragraph",
      "reading_order": 3,
      "text": "We call our particular attention \"Scaled Dot-Product Attention\" (Figure 2). The input consists of queries and keys of dimension $d _ { k }$ , and values of dimension $d _ { v }$ . We compute the dot products of the query with all keys, divide each by $\\sqrt { d _ { k } }$ , and apply a softmax function to obtain the weights on the values. ",
      "source": "mineru",
      "quality": "structured_review_required",
      "metadata": {
        "mineru_type": "text",
        "text_level": null,
        "reconstruction": "MinerU structured output; verify against original region",
        "parser_version": "2.7.6",
        "device": "cpu",
        "parse_id": "2b0232877a244809af1ca61e7320b37d",
        "models": [
