      "text": "Instead of performing a single attention function with $d _ { \\mathrm { m o d e l } }$ -dimensional keys, values and queries, we found it beneficial to linearly project the queries, keys and values $h$ times with different, learned linear projections to $d _ { k }$ , $d _ { k }$ and $d _ { v }$ dimensions, respectively. On each of these projected versions of queries, keys and values we then perform the attention function in parallel, yielding $d _ { v }$ -dimensional ",
